### Thanos

Thanos is the end of a long road, and the only hero you cannot simply craft or find. Hold **the Tesseract in one hand and Loki's Scepter in the other** and hold right-click for five seconds, in open country with the sky above you, to **call the Mad Titan**: a portal opens in the sky and he falls through it. Beat him (he takes a new Infinity Stone every 90 seconds of fighting, so do it fast and do it together) and he rewards **an Infinity Gauntlet** to everyone who did 3 percent of his health and to whoever struck the last blow. **Hold the Gauntlet for three seconds with no power** and you become Thanos. Neither the Tesseract nor the Scepter is ever used up. The fight is on [Thanos](Thanos).

Once you hold the Gauntlet you are Thanos: the five stones of the Power Blast, the Portal Step, the Transmute, the Soul Drain and the Rewind are on **R, G, V, B and N** (Sneak for the other five), and you are a tank with a toolbox. You can also give the Gauntlet to a friend who has no power, and take the fight again later. See [Playing Thanos](Thanos#playing-thanos).
